      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOARING SOLO (4) led for much of the way before fading right out of it late when finishing well back at Carnarvon last time out. Her prior form was much better however, so I'm happy to overlook one bad run. Can bounce back with a bang. BLOWIN' SMOKE (5) finished out of the money two starts back then he settled well back and was beaten 3 lengths when fourth over 1400m at Carnarvon six days ago. Well placed and there is no reason he cannot find winning ways. DRAGONFLIES (6) finds it hard to win with three victories from 38 starts. Again tasted defeat last start when ninth over 1200m at Carnarvon. Best figures measure up nicely. Makes plenty of appeal. KEYTRADE (2) missed the placings two runs back then improved last start but found a couple better over 1200m at Carnarvon, beaten 2 lengths. Another forward showing is anticipated. LACEVINSKY (1) is next best.",
